Description: Distiller CM5 Python AI Assistant Application
 The Distiller CM5 Python project is a comprehensive AI assistant application
 for the Distiller CM5 platform. It features a conversational interface that
 supports both command-line and GUI modes.
 .
 Key Features:
  • Dual interface architecture (CLI and Qt/QML GUI)
  • LLM integration with local llama-cpp servers and remote providers
  • MCP (Model Context Protocol) server support
  • Hardware interfacing capabilities including audio, display, and LED control
  • Speech-to-text processing with faster_whisper
  • E-ink display control via distiller-cm5-sdk and direct SPI/GPIO access
  • UART-based power management signaling
  • Modular LLM integration with automatic server lifecycle management
  • Direct hardware control for SPI and GPIO interfaces
 .
 This package provides the core Python application for running AI assistant
 functionality on the Distiller CM5 platform, with support for both
 standalone operation and integration with the broader Distiller ecosystem.
